<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/landing.css">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'><rect width='32' height='32' rx='6' fill='%232563eb'/><text x='16' y='23' font-size='20' text-anchor='middle' fill='white' font-family='system-ui' font-weight='bold'>J</text></svg>">
</head>
<body>

<!-- ── Nav ── -->
<nav class="landing-nav">
  <div class="landing-nav-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo">Just<span>Invoice</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/setup">Setup guide</a>
      <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a href="/signup" class="btn-primary">Get started free</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ── Hero ── -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-badge">🎉 Free during early access — $9/mo after launch</div>
  <h1>Invoicing that doesn't<br><em>nickel-and-dime you.</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">
    <strong>Free while we're in early access.</strong> $9/month after launch — unlimited invoices,
    no percentage cuts, no feature caps, no "contact us for pricing."
    Just a clean way to bill your clients and get paid.
  </p>
  <div class="hero-cta">
    <a href="/signup" class="btn-primary">Get started free</a>
    <a href="/pricing" class="btn-outline">See pricing</a>
  </div>
  <p class="hero-sub-cta">No credit card required. Set up in 2 minutes.</p>
</section>

<!-- ── How it works ── -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <p class="section-label">How it works</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Create. Send. Get paid.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Three steps. No accounting degree required.</p>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">1</div>
      <h3>Create your invoice</h3>
      <p>Pick a client, add line items, set a due date. That's it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">2</div>
      <h3>Send it</h3>
      <p>One click to email a clean PDF — or copy a share link.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="step">
      <div class="step-num">3</div>
      <h3>Get paid</h3>
      <p>Client pays by card via Stripe. Status updates automatically.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Features ── -->
<section class="section">
  <p class="section-label">Features</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Everything you need. Nothing you don't.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Built for freelancers who want professional invoicing without the accounting software rabbit hole.</p>
  <div class="features-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 14.25v-2.625a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375h-1.5A1.125 1.125 0 0113.5 7.125v-1.5a3.375 3.375 0 00-3.375-3.375H8.25m0 12.75h7.5m-7.5 3H12M10.5 2.25H5.625c-.621 0-1.125.504-1.125 1.125v17.25c0 .621.504 1.125 1.125 1.125h12.75c.621 0 1.125-.504 1.125-1.125V11.25a9 9 0 00-9-9z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Professional PDF invoices</h3>
      <p>Clean, print-ready PDFs your clients will actually take seriously.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.25 8.25h19.5M2.25 9h19.5m-16.5 5.25h6m-6 2.25h3m-3.75 3h15a2.25 2.25 0 002.25-2.25V6.75A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 004.5 19.5z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Stripe payments</h3>
      <p>Accept credit and debit cards directly. Money lands in your account — we never touch it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M21.75 6.75v10.5a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25 2.25h-15a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.25-2.25V6.75m19.5 0A2.25 2.25 0 0019.5 4.5h-15a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25 2.25m19.5 0v.243a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07 1.916l-7.5 4.615a2.25 2.25 0 01-2.36 0L3.32 8.91a2.25 2.25 0 01-1.07-1.916V6.75"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>One-click email</h3>
      <p>Send the invoice to your client with a single click. No copy-paste into Gmail.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 19.128a9.38 9.38 0 002.625.372 9.337 9.337 0 004.121-.952 4.125 4.125 0 00-7.533-2.493M15 19.128v-.003c0-1.113-.285-2.16-.786-3.07M15 19.128v.106A12.318 12.318 0 018.624 21c-2.331 0-4.512-.645-6.374-1.766l-.001-.109a6.375 6.375 0 0111.964-3.07M12 6.375a3.375 3.375 0 11-6.75 0 3.375 3.375 0 016.75 0zm8.25 2.25a2.625 2.625 0 11-5.25 0 2.625 2.625 0 015.25 0z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Unlimited clients</h3>
      <p>Add as many clients as you have. Track who's paid and who hasn't.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Status tracking</h3>
      <p>Draft, sent, paid — know exactly where every invoice stands.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon">
        <svg width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.53 16.122a3 3 0 00-5.78 1.128 2.25 2.25 0 01-2.4 2.245 4.5 4.5 0 008.4-2.245c0-.399-.078-.78-.22-1.128zm0 0a15.998 15.998 0 003.388-1.62m-5.043-.025a15.994 15.994 0 011.622-3.395m3.42 3.42a15.995 15.995 0 004.764-4.648l3.876-5.814a1.151 1.151 0 00-1.597-1.597L14.146 6.32a15.996 15.996 0 00-4.649 4.763m3.42 3.42a6.776 6.776 0 00-3.42-3.42"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Clean, minimal design</h3>
      <p>No clutter, no bloat. Your clients get a professional experience. So do you.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Pricing ── -->
<section class="section section-alt" id="pricing">
  <p class="section-label">Pricing</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">One plan. No surprises.</h2>
  <p class="section-sub">Everything you need, nothing you don't. Pricing that actually makes sense.</p>
  <div class="pricing-wrapper">
    <div class="pricing-card">
      <div style="display:inline-block; background:#2563eb; color:#fff; font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.03em; padding:0.3rem 0.85rem; border-radius:999px; margin-bottom:1rem;">🎉 Free Early Access</div>
      <div class="price">$9<span>/month</span></div>
      <p class="price-sub">Free now. $9/month after launch. No transaction fees.</p>
      <ul class="pricing-features">
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
          Unlimited invoices
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
          Unlimited clients
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
          PDF generation
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
          Stripe payment links
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
          One-click email sending
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
          No transaction fees
        </li>
        <li>
          <svg width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4.5 12.75l6 6 9-13.5"/></svg>
          Cancel anytime
        </li>
      </ul>
      <a href="/signup" class="btn-primary">Join free — lock in your spot</a>
      <p style="font-size:0.8rem; color:var(--muted); margin-top:0.75rem;">No credit card required during early access.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pricing-comparison">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th></th>
          <th>JustInvoice</th>
          <th>Wave</th>
          <th>FreshBooks</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td>Monthly cost</td>
          <td><strong>Free now</strong> <span style="font-size:0.8em; color:var(--muted);">($9/mo after launch)</span></td>
          <td>Free (but 2.9% + 60¢ per transaction)</td>
          <td>From $17/mo</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Unlimited invoices</td>
          <td class="check">✓</td>
          <td class="cross">✗</td>
          <td>Only on higher tiers</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>No transaction fees</td>
          <td class="check">✓</td>
          <td class="cross">✗</td>
          <td class="check">✓</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Clean, simple UI</td>
          <td class="check">✓</td>
          <td>Cluttered</td>
          <td>Bloated</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── FAQ ── -->
<section class="section">
  <p class="section-label">FAQ</p>
  <h2 class="section-title">Questions? Answers.</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
    <details>
      <summary>Do I need an account to send an invoice?</summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Yes — your account keeps your invoices, clients, and settings private and secure. Sign-up takes about 30 seconds.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I use my own domain for invoice links?</summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">For now, invoice links use the JustInvoice domain. You can deploy JustInvoice on your own server with your own domain if you self-host — the codebase is self-contained.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>What payment methods can clients use?</summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Any card Stripe accepts — Visa, Mastercard, American Express, Discover, and more. ACH, bank transfers, and wallets depend on your Stripe account configuration.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Can I cancel anytime?</summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Yes. Cancel whenever you like from your settings page. Your data stays accessible (exportable) even after cancellation.</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>Is there a free trial?</summary>
      <p class="faq-answer">Better than a trial — it's free during early access. Sign up now at no cost, use everything, and lock in your spot before we launch at $9/month. No bait-and-switch.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── CTA ── -->
<section class="section section-alt">
  <div style="text-align:center;">
    <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-0.02em; margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Ready to stop overpaying for invoicing?</h2>
    <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:1.75rem; font-size:1.05rem;">Join free now. $9/mo after launch — lock in your spot.</p>
    <a href="/signup" class="btn-primary">Join free — lock in your spot</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ── Footer ── -->
<footer class="landing-footer">
  <div class="landing-footer-inner">
    <a href="/" class="logo">Just<span>Invoice</span></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/login">Log in</a>
      <a href="/pricing">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/setup">Setup guide</a>
      <a href="/signup">Get started</a>
    </nav>
    <small>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> JustInvoice. Built for freelancers.</small>
  </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
